WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Several unfinished plans.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:11.000
Probably a phone, actually.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:17.000
And snacks. Do not forget snacks.

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:23.000
Traveller. Occasional director. Professional overpacker?

00:00:23.000 --> 00:00:28.000
No algorithms were consulted.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:33.000
The world can wait until she is ready.
